{"title":"Increase mem-load container memory limits","body":"Root cause: The mem-load container's memory limit (32Mi) is too low for its workload, causing OOM kills.
Evidence: Warning   BackOff   Back-off restarting failed container mem-load in pod vigil-app-c7dcd7f98-b9r2x_default(...)

This PR updates the Deployment manifest to raise the mem-load container requests to 16Mi and limits to 64Mi."}
